"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105944","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105944.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105944.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-07T17:54:39Z"},"body":"This PR adds an editor setting `interface/editor/collapse_main_menu` to collapse the main menu. It replaces `MenuBar` with a `MenuButton` to reduce clutter on the title bar. Given the limited screen space on mobile, the full menubar occupies too much horizontal space. On devices with a more square-ish aspect ratio, some of the content also gets cut off on the right side.\r\n\r\n![square-ish tablet](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b4d9e3e-9036-4477-b0b5-5cdf26cd99dd)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe new button opens a popup containing the same menu options previously available in the menubar, preserving functionality while making the layout compact.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6491b358-9e5e-4b2f-b3d3-70dc03893d63\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use